   ],
   "about": "requestAttributes.x is ${subject.isM2M.x}, a path after isM2M, which a whole value takes (round 37). The upload is taken if the check matches the part before the first dot, and refused (400) if it matches the whole placeholder, which is no declared name. Taken, the call carries null if the path selects nothing in the builtin's value; the text as written if a placeholder with a path is not substituted; and every request that reads the PIP answers 400 if the path fails the request as a whole ${subject.isM2M} does.",
   "condition": "subject.parityR38RaIsM2MPath == 'v' OR resource.a == 'y'",
